        {
          "index": 0,
          "zh": "崇禎元年，王在晉為尚書。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "zh": "世龍上疏極論其罪，有詔逮世龍，久不至。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "zh": "在晉罷，始詣獄。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "zh": "二年冬，都城戒嚴。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 4,
          "zh": "刑部尚書喬允升薦世龍才，詔圖功自贖。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 5,
          "zh": "會祖大壽師潰，京師大震。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 6,
          "zh": "承宗再起督師，以便宜遣世龍馳諭大壽聽命。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
        },
        {
          "index": 7,
          "zh": "及滿桂戰死，遂令世龍代為總理，賜尚方劍，盡統諸鎮援師。",
          "literal": "",
          "idiomatic": "",
          "translator": "Garrett M. Petersen (2026)",
          "model": "Manual source repair"
